# NOTE: every pattern in this file is mirrored verbatim in .vercelignore. The
# Vercel CLI never reads .gitignore, so the mirror is what keeps these classes
# off a workstation deployment. tools/security/deploy_surface.test.mjs fails
# when the two files drift -- add new entries to both.

# Environment variables - NEVER commit these
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.production.local

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log
yarn-error.log
package-lock.json

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Build outputs
dist/
build/
.next/
out/

# Python bytecode (generated by tools/pastpapers and tools/notes)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party source material. THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC.
#
# Past Papers source copies are third-party-hosted scans of examination papers,
# watermarked and carrying the host's marketing. Committing them would be public
# redistribution of third-party material. The production pipeline has no runtime
# dependency on them: the structured spec is the durable input. They stay on
# disk, and out of git, deliberately.
meoclass1/pastpapers/docs/*.pdf

# Local-only provenance record. Names the third-party host of each source copy
# and the identifier printed on it. Kept off the public repository by design;
# see meoclass1/pastpapers/docs/CURRENT_STATUS.md.
meoclass1/pastpapers/verification/LOCAL_SOURCE_PROVENANCE.md

# Coaching handouts. Never a verification source, never redistributed.
Notes-for-written-answers/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vercel project link. THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC.
#
# `.vercel/project.json` carries the Vercel projectId and the orgId (team id).
# Vercel's own bundled README in that folder states it should not be shared, and
# normally self-adds this entry on `vercel link` -- that did not happen here, so
# the folder sat untracked and unignored, one `git add .` away from publication.
# It is machine-local deployment state with no build dependency: any workstation
# recreates it by linking the project.
.vercel/

# Scratch output from the notes tooling (`tools/notes/*.py` write these while
# auditing the master index and QB matches). Regenerable, never an input.
tools/notes/_*.txt

# Founder's master question-bank source material, staged for the notes and oral
# pipelines but never product output. This repository is public -- committing any
# of it would publish the unreleased bank, and the surveyor compilation is a
# third-party document MIW does not own. Cover every carrier format, not just the
# spreadsheets: the raw 788-question oral compilation arrived as .docx and sat
# untracked AND unignored, one `git add -A` away from publication. Local-only by
# default; remove an entry deliberately if a file is ever cleared for publication.
docs/MIW-master-Question-bank/*.xlsx
docs/MIW-master-Question-bank/*.docx
docs/MIW-master-Question-bank/*.doc
docs/MIW-master-Question-bank/*.pdf
.env*

# Candidate-supplied study material. Handwritten notes and their transcription were
# sent privately by a named candidate and used only as a discovery aid for the
# 2026-08-12 feedback audit. This repository is public -- committing them would
# publish a third party's private study material. Local-only, permanently.
meoclass1/pastpapers/docs/notes from candidate/

# True Source corpus packages. THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC.
#
# `Knowledge Central/` holds the MIW True Source corpora -- verbatim IMO
# instrument text (FSS Code chapters, Casualty Investigation Code provisions)
# transcribed from official and paid sources. Committing it would republish
# copyrighted IMO material wholesale, which is a different act from the
# provision-at-a-time quotation cleared for the products under FD-RIGHTS-1.
# It is also the private authoring layer: products consume a projection of the
# corpus, never the store itself. The folder sat untracked AND unignored, one
# `git add .` away from publication. Local-only, permanently -- further corpus
# packages land here over time and are covered by this rule automatically.
Knowledge Central/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Six-year QP intelligence, DERIVED. Rebuilt from two committed inputs --
# meoclass1/pastpapers/specs/QP*.json and
# meoclass1/pastpapers/intelligence/historical_qp_intelligence.json -- by
# tools/pastpapers/build_sixyear_intelligence.py. Internal analysis only: it
# carries printed question wording for unsolved sittings and the third-party
# host's recurrence annotations, neither of which may reach a built artefact.
# Committing it would create a second source of truth about lineage.
meoclass1/pastpapers/intelligence/derived/
